  "content": "\n\n# 光标扩展\n\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"default\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/default.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"pointing_hand\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/pointing_hand.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"grabbing\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/grabbing.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"ibeam\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/ibeam.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"shift\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/shift.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"busy\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/busy.gif\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"not_allowed\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/not_allowed.png\" />\n<img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"crosshair\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/crosshair.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"resize_all\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_all.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"resize_ew\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ew.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"resize_ns\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_ns.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"resize_nwse\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nwse.png\" />\n<img width=\"33\" height=\"33\" alt=\"resize_nesw\" src=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/assets/cursors/resize_nesw.png\" />\n\n用充满我的世界主题的光标替换掉无聊的旧版系统默认光标。\n\n在 1.21.9 为该模组引入大量不兼容更新之前，它曾被称为 [Minecraft Cursor](https://github.com/fishstiz/minecraft-cursor/blob/master/README.md)。\n\n## 📌 需求\n\n- 若使用 Fabric 加载器：需要 Fabric API\n\n## ✨ 功能\n\n- 使用资源包自定义光标纹理。\n- 通过自定义动画让光标“活”起来。\n- 包含适用于其他场景的额外光标形状。\n- 通过 [**传统模式**](https://fishstiz.github.io/minecraft-cursor-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started#all-cursors) 为各种 GUI 元素增强光标逻辑。\n- 根据个人喜好调整各项选项。前往模组列表界面，或依次点击 选项 › 控制 › 鼠标设置 › 光标设置。\n\n![cursors_extended](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/o5fhgLeQ/images/6d6d002908e179dbfe11096af85f1f9a37d71189.gif)\n\n## 🖌️ 创建资源包\n\n制作你自己的资源包，在支持的平台分享，并有机会在此 [展示](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase)！\n\n<a href=\"https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/showcase\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishstiz/resources/refs/heads/main/cursors-extended/showcase.gif\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Showcase\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bedrock-style-cursors\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dUA5FyFq/images/28f9504fa044c59491a1555494b3e579eec186a1.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Bedrock-Style Cursors\"/>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n已经为 Minecraft Cursor v3 制作过资源包？使用 [**V3 转换器**](https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/tools/#v3-converter) 进行转换。\n\n在此开始：https://fishstiz.github.io/cursors_extended-wiki/resource-pack/getting-started",
